@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki.integration"

Feature:  Koroneiki To OSB Account Integration
	Testing to assure that koroneiki account integration to OSB and Project Details works properly.

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I tear down the external links for the account "Korone - ${staticProjectName}" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| 1234 |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Kchild - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Ochild - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Korone - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Oneiki - ${staticProjectName} |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following "Code" values
	| KCHILDKCHILD |
	| OCHILDOCHILD |
	| KORONEKORONE |
	| ONEIKIONEIKI |

Scenario: Create regular account
	Testing the ability to create a regular tiered project on Koroneiki that later gets synced to OSB

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORONEKORONE                         |
	| Contact Email Address | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test osb account on koroneiki        |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name                  | Korone - ${staticProjectName}        |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes             |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Profile Email Address | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	| Tier                  | Regular                              |
	| Website               | www.koroneikicorporation.com         |
	And I log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test" on the sandbox
	And I go to the OSB admin main page on the sandbox
	And I update a project with the code "KORONEKORONE" using the following values on the sandbox
	| Region   | US      |
	| Language | English |
	Then I should be able to view a project with the name "Korone - ${staticProjectName}" and following values on the sandbox
	| Koroneiki Account Key | Obtain from project name      |
	| Project Name          | Korone - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code                  | KORONEKORONE                  |
	| Tier                  | Regular                       |
	| Description           | Test osb account on koroneiki |
	| Additional Notes	    | Additional account notes      |
	When I go to the Project Details page on sandbox
	And I search for the project with the name "Korone - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I go to the project with the name "Korone - ${staticProjectName}"
	Then the project details with the following values should be visible
	| Project Code    | KORONEKORONE |
	| Status          | APPROVED     |
	| Support Region  | US           |
	| Tier            | Regular      |
	When I go to the History tab
	And I generate the account ID value for "Korone - ${staticProjectName}"
	Then the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "contactEmailAddress" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin                      |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                        |
	| Update Date                 | Today                                |
	| Update Field Name           | contactEmailAddress                  |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                  |
	| Update Field New Value      | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "internal" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | internal        |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | false           |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "code" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | code            |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | KORONEKORONE    |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "notes" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin          |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account            |
	| Update Date                 | Today                    |
	| Update Field Name           | notes                    |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                      |
	| Update Field New Value      | Additional account notes |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "region" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | region          |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | United States   |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "description" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin               |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
	| Update Field Name           | description                   |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | Test osb account on koroneiki |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "parentAccountId" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | parentAccountId |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | 0               |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "tier" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | tier            |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | Regular         |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "website" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin              |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                |
	| Update Date                 | Today                        |
	| Update Field Name           | website                      |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                          |
	| Update Field New Value      | www.koroneikicorporation.com |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "accountId" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin    |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account      |
	| Update Date                 | Today              |
	| Update Field Name           | accountId          |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                |
	| Update Field New Value      | ${staticAccountId} |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "phoneNumber" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | phoneNumber     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | 555-555-5678    |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "name" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin               |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
	| Update Field Name           | name                          |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | Korone - ${staticProjectName} |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "faxNumber" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | faxNumber       |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | 555-555-1234    |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "statusByUserName" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin  |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account    |
	| Update Date                 | Today            |
	| Update Field Name           | statusByUserName |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A              |
	| Update Field New Value      | Koroneiki Admin  |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "profileEmailAddress" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin                      |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                        |
	| Update Date                 | Today                                |
	| Update Field Name           | profileEmailAddress                  |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                  |
	| Update Field New Value      | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And the history entry in position number "1" with the field value "status" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account   |
	| Update Date                 | Today           |
	| Update Field Name           | status          |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A             |
	| Update Field New Value      | 0               |
	And the history entry in position number "2" with the field value "name" should be visible with the following values
